   - impartial appointment and recusal standards;
   - confidentiality and anti-retaliation protections;
   - transparent timelines and appeal rights;
   - preservation of any collective-bargaining rights;
   - a transition plan for pending matters.

6. **Submit a formal resolution or policy petition.**  
