2. Confirm the applicant’s authority to develop the registered ring section for this purpose;
3. Refer the technical package to the Engineering and Safety Authorities;
4. Approve the proposed berth subject to final drawings, inspection, and commissioning;
5. Record the completed berth as a privately owned facility attached to Registered Ring Section **[designation]**;
6. Issue an operating certificate after successful testing;
7. Recognize the applicant as the initial owner and operator.

